  message: "Fixed in PR #2031. Added nested class guard to _is_import_class_mismatch: if resolved symbol is a nested class (class/interface/enum with dot in name) but lookup used bare name from a different file, skip the edge. Eliminates Properties/Logger false positives from Kafka bakeoff."  # 629c
